<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-BELGIUM TAKE UNBEATABLE 3-0 LEAD OVER SPAIN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELGIUM TAKE UNBEATABLE 3-0 LEAD OVER SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>SPRIMONT, Belgium 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium took a winning</p>
<p>3-0 lead over Spain in their Fed Cup tennis world group one,</p>
<p>first-round match after winning the first reverse singles on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Belgian names first)</p>
<p>Played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Sabine Appelmans beat Arantxa Sanchez Vicario 6-3 2-6 8-6</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Els Callens beat Sanchez Vicario 6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Appelmans beat Maria Luisa Serna 6-1 4-6 6-3</p>
</text>
